<title>UK: BT exec named chairman at WS Atkins.</title>
<headline>BT exec named chairman at WS Atkins.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alan W. Rudge, Deputy  Chief Executive at British Telecommunications plc, has been appointed chairman of WS Atkins plc, with effect from November 11, the British construction and technology consultancy said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Atkins said Terrel Wyatt, chairman since 1987, and Robert Hawley, a non-executive director since 1994, will leave the board following the annual meeting in September. Both men were instrumental in Atkins' 1996 flotation.</p>
<p>--London newsroom, 44 171 542 7717</p>
